href":"/en/tip/10-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"To build closeness, have two people take turns answering a series of progressively deeper questions — no script needed"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Long-distance relationships aren’t worse than local ones — the real challenge comes in the first three months after moving in together"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Check registration statistics before listening to elders: what do “marriage rate” and “divorce rate” actually mean?"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Accounting for the health benefits of marriage while adjusting for observational data"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Discussing labor division before marriage helps clarify unpaid work responsibilities"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"First check the default legal rules regarding marriage money and property, then decide whether to make a written agreement"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"When parents pay for a house, they should clearly state whether it’s a loan or a gift at the time of transfer"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/10-12","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Money borrowed by a spouse in a large amount — if you didn’t sign or later acknowledge it, it doesn’t automatically become your debt"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Obtaining a marriage certificate requires only an ID card and a signed declaration — no household register needed, no fees, and issuance is immediate"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Undergoing a premarital medical exam: if a serious illness is present, it must be disclosed before marriage registration"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Calculating the cost of walking away: Divorce by mutual agreement requires a 30-day cooling-off period, while divorce via litigation has strict legal prerequisites"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Make a separate tally for the benefits to your elders when they get married — don’t mix it with your own records"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Treating relationship quality as a health factor: focus on the issue, not the person — avoid insults and sarcasm"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"While both partners are of sound mind, complete power of attorney, designated guardianship, and wills: Legally, you are not close relatives; without these, you will have no signing authority or inheritance rights."]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Don’t marry while hiding your sexual orientation, and don’t treat “marriage of convenience” as an easy shortcut: legally, it is a real marriage, and the only way out is divorce"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"When a relationship is stuck in endless arguments and silent treatment, couples therapy can help — waiting alone rarely does"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"child